        "type": "object",
        "title": "Mandate Imports",
        "description": "Mandate Imports allow you to migrate existing mandates from other providers into the\nGoCardless platform.\n\nThe process is as follows:\n\n  1. [Create a mandate import](#mandate-imports-create-a-new-mandate-import)\n  2. [Add entries](#mandate-import-entries-add-a-mandate-import-entry) to the import\n  3. [Submit](#mandate-imports-submit-a-mandate-import) the import\n  4. Wait until a member of the GoCardless team approves the import, at which point the mandates will be created\n  5. [Link up the mandates](#mandate-import-entries-list-all-mandate-import-entries) in your system\n\nWhen you add entries to your mandate import, they are not turned into actual mandates\nuntil the mandate import is submitted by you via the API, and then processed by a member\nof the GoCardless team. When that happens, a mandate will be created for each entry in the import.\n\nWe will issue a `mandate_created` webhook for each entry, which will be the same as the webhooks\ntriggered when [ creating a mandate ](#mandates-create-a-mandate) using the mandates API. Once these\nwebhooks start arriving, any reconciliation can now be accomplished by\n[checking the current status](#mandate-imports-get-a-mandate-import) of the mandate import and\n[linking up the mandates to your system](#mandate-import-entries-list-all-mandate-import-entries).\n\n<p class=\"notice\">Note that all Mandate Imports have an upper limit of 30,000 entries, so we recommend you split your import into several smaller imports if you're planning to exceed this threshold.</p>\n\n<p class=\"restricted-notice\"><strong>Restricted</strong>: This API is currently only available for approved integrators - please <a href=\"mailto:help@gocardless.com\">get in touch</a> if you would like to use this API.</p>",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique identifier, beginning with \"IM\".",
            "example": "IM123"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Fixed [timestamp](#api-usage-dates-and-times), recording when this resource was created.",
            "example": "2014-01-01T12:00:00.000Z",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "status": {
            "description": "The status of the mandate import.\n\n- `created`: A new mandate import.\n- `submitted`: After the integrator has finished adding mandates and [submitted](#mandate-imports-submit-a-mandate-import) the import.\n- `cancelled`: If the integrator [cancelled](#mandate-imports-cancel-a-mandate-import) the mandate import.\n- `processing`: Once a mandate import has been approved by a GoCardless team member it will be in this state while mandates are imported.\n- `processed`: When all mandates have been imported successfully.",
            "example": "created",
            "enum": [
              "created",
              "submitted",
              "cancelled",
              "processing",
              "processed"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "scheme": {
            "description": "The scheme of the mandates to be imported.<br>All mandates in a single mandate\nimport must be for the same scheme.",
            "example": "bacs",
            "enum": [
              "ach",
              "autogiro",
              "bacs",
              "becs",
              "becs_nz",
              "betalingsservice",
              "faster_payments",
              "pad",
              "pay_to",
              "sepa_core"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "links": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Related resources",
            "properties": {
              "creditor": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "ID of the associated creditor.",
                "example": "CR123"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "mandate_import_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "MandateImportId",
        "description": "Unique identifier, beginning with \"IM\".",
        "example": "IM123"
      },
      "mandate_import_identity": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "MandateImportIdentity",
        "description": "Unique identifier, beginning with \"IM\".",
        "example": "IM123"
      },
